        "sid": "MAT 20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "20",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Phahi ufalume ambao Mlungu wanipha unaelezwa ni ndarira hino. Mchina-munda mmwenga warauka chiti achendaendza atu a vibaruwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariphophahana na hara vibaruwa kuaripha maripho ga kutwa, waaphirika akarime mundawe wa mizabibu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuya mchina-munda wauka tsona achiphiya cheteni kama saa tahu za ligundzu, achendaona atu anjina aimire bila ya kazi yoyosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Achiaambira, ‘Mwimwi piya phiyani mkahende kazi munda wa mizabibu, nami nindakuriphani haki yenu.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi hinyo atu aphiya. Yuya mchina-munda waphiya tsona cheteni kpwendalola vibaruwa anjina wakati wa saa sita na saa tisiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wauya tsona muda wa saa kumi na mwenga achiona atu anjina aimire hipho cheteni. Na achiauza, ‘Mbona muimire hipha mutsi wosi bila ya kazi?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao achimuamba, ‘Kpwa sababu tahuphahire mutu wa kuhupha chibaruwa.’ Yuya mchina-munda achiaambira, ‘Haya, phiyani mkahende kazi munda wangu wa mizabibu.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
