            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.19.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Alawi 19:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.24.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kumbukumbu 24:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Dziloni, yuya mchina-munda wa mizabibu wamuiha mwiiki wa pesa na achimuamba, ‘Iha vibaruwa osi uariphe haki yao, kuandzira hara a mwisho na umarigize na hara a mwandzo.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi akpwedza hara kala akahewa kazi saa kumi na mwenga, nao achiriphiwa maripho ga kutwa chila mmwenga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hara arioandza kazi mwandzo ariphokpwedzariphiwa haki yao, aona andahewa zaidi, ela nao piya ariphiwa maripho ga kutwa chila mmwenga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariphophokera pesa zao, aandza kumnungʼunikira yuya mchina-munda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amuamba, ‘Hinya vibaruwa uchioareha mwisho, akahenda kazi saa mwenga bahi. Mbona ukaaripha sawa na swiswi huchiohenda kazi ngumu ya kutwa ndzima na dzuwa kali?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela achimuamba yuya mmwenga, ‘Msena wangu, sikakuonera hata chidide! Kpwani tahukaphahana maripho ga kutwa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hala hakiyo uuke. Nkamendza kumupha hiyu wa mwisho sawa na uwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dze, nikale sina haki ya kuhenda nilondavyo na pesa zangu? Dze, uzuri wangu unauonera chidzitso?’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
