            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.19.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mathayo 19:30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.10.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mariko 10:31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.13.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luka 13:30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chimarigizo Jesu waamba, “Phahi a mwisho andakala a kpwandza na a kpwandza andakala a mwisho.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu ariphokala anaphiya Jerusalemu, himo njirani, wahala hara anafundzi kumi na airi achiphiya nao njama, achiaambira, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Phundzani, vivi hunaphiya Jerusalemu, ambako mimi, Mutu Yela Mlunguni, nindalaviwa kpwa akulu a alavyadzi-sadaka na alimu a Shariya, nao andaniamula nikaolagbwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha andanilavya kpwa atu ambao sio Ayahudi. Nao andanizemerera, andanichapa viboko na anikote msalabani. Ela siku ya hahu nindafufuka.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bada ya muda, mkpwaza Zebedayo waphiya kpwa Jesu phamwenga na anae, achendachita mavwindi Jesu achimuamba, “Bwana, navoya chitu chimwenga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu achimuuza, “Nikuhendereni?” Hiye mchetu achiamba, “Niahidi kukala ndiphoandza kutawala, hinya anangu airi, mmwenga asagale uphandeo wa kulume na wanjina uphandeo wa kumotso.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela achiaambira, “Tammanya mvoyaro. Dze, munaweza kuvumirira mateso ambago gandaniphaha?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20:22",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Chiyunani chinaamba,",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Jesu achiaambira, “Dze, munaweza kunwerera chikombe ndichochinwerera?” Nao achijibu, “Hunaweza.”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nao achimuamba, “Hunaweza.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu achiaambira, “Mundagaya dza vivyo ndivyogaya, ela kusagala uphande wangu wa kulume au wa kumotso siyo kazi yangu kupanga. Dzambo hiro andahewa hara ambao aikirwa ni Baba ariye mlunguni.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hara anafundzi kumi ariphosikira hivyo, aareyera hara ndugu airi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
